### 2a: a banking assistant (tool calling). Watch the console for the tool loop.
@host = http://localhost:8099

### A1. Ask about the double charge. The model calls a read-only tool.
POST {{host}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "stage-1",
  "message": "Why was I charged twice at Acme Coffee?"
}

### A2. Ask for a dispute. The model proposes it. It can't open it.
POST {{host}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "stage-1",
  "message": "Yes, please dispute the second charge."
}

### A3. My disputes: the new one is PENDING_CONFIRMATION
GET {{host}}/api/disputes

### A4. The customer confirms it (D-1005 after a fresh start)
POST {{host}}/api/disputes/D-1005/confirm
